{"name":"-44-A4-1","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"2021white_Safehouse","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"10194","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Ange's temporary hideout."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So what are we going to do?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AN94","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"First of all, we can't just barge in there without making any preparations. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"No matter what the Earl did or did not tell me, all I know is that the mansion is connected to William. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It may look abandoned, but I'd still treat it as a well-defended stronghold."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I can contact my subordinates."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yes, but only bring the ones that you absolutely trust. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If you can't be sure about them, I'd rather you come alone."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I understand."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The mansion is located in Berlin itself, but in a rather remote wealthy suburb. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's not densely populated and the area is very safe and peaceful. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We'll definitely draw attention to ourselves if we march in there with a large force."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK15","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But conversely, Paradeus can't station a large force there either."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"94, you and Light take his men and stand guard outside. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Light at least has emergency law enforcement authority in Germany. Even if we end up drawing unwanted attention, we don't have to worry about things getting completely out of hand. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Besides, we could use the backup."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Understood."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"15, 16, you two stay with me. We're going in through the front door. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"According to the latest intelligence, the mansion is currently uninhabited...but who knows if that's actually true. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Still, right now I don't see the need to enter through another entrance. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"15 will take charge of the assault while 16 scans for electric signals. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Report any discovery immediately."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK15","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Understood."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RPK16","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RPK-16","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Understood."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's it. No plan, no strategy. Your only order—do not open fire. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Of course, if you really run into Paradeus goons... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Feel free to blow their brains out. I'll take responsibility."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RPK16","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RPK-16","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So when are we setting off?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We leave at three. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We must be well-prepared for this."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ange puts away the map on the table and pauses."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm sure the Earl has heard of my visit at the bar by now. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'm giving him time to contact me. If I still don't hear from him by three o'clock... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'm not to blame."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Miss Ange."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I would like to have a word with you."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ange glances at the DEFY members, who have gone off to make their respective preparations."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Now?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"When else?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Alright."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ange pulls out a chair and gestures for Light to take a seat as well."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What do you want to talk about? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You're not trying to weasel out of this, are you?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Of course not. I respect you and trust your judgment."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't remember being particularly respectable. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Goody-two-shoes like you don't tend to mix with people like me, yeah? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You look like the type that gets an A even in ethics at the secret service academy."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I never took such a class... You have a secret service academy in the Soviet Union?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Of course. Don't you have one in Germany? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We got to pick our own dog partner in our first class. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Then for our graduation exam, we had to shoot it."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"How terribly cruel... Was it to ensure each agent's ability to follow orders without question?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I think the instructor just preferred cats."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Uh, are you pulling my leg?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Isn't it obvious?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Please stop teasing me. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I could really use your advice about something important."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Go on then. I'll try my best if it's something I can help you with. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But don't get your hopes up. Like I said, I am no role model. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I don't even know what I've done for you to think so highly of me."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You're too modest, but that's not the point. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I hope I can be someone like you one day."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What do you mean, someone like me?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A hero."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"All so-called \"heroes\" have their names etched onto memorials, whelp."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It is in a hero's nature to keep going forward no matter how many people have fallen before them. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I wish to become just like you and all those who came before you, to devote myself to making this world a better place. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Even if it costs me my life."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Aren't you too young to be talking about such things?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm getting there, Miss Ange. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"At least I'm getting there."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...What gives you such notions?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I know this may all sound very silly and childish to you. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But...I genuinely admire you because everything you do... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You do for the sake of the future of this world."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...This is neither silly nor childish. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Light, idealists don't have a single place in this day and age. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But that doesn't mean idealism deserves to die. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It is extremely difficult to maintain such a pure and simple outlook like yours. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Which makes it all the more precious."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Thank you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So is this what you need my advice for? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Doesn't seem like it to me. Your will is strong enough as it is. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"No matter what I say, you believe in your own vision."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Indeed..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Light reaches into his pouch and fishes out a cufflink."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"\"U\"? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...The Stasi has such funny rules. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Do all senior agents have to adopt a letter for their codename?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"They say it's because there just so happened to be 26 agents in the very beginning. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"And the first letter of their names were all different."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then shouldn't you be \"L\"?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Our codenames aren't determined by our names anymore. We choose a word that we like and take the first letter instead. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The word can be a representation of the agent."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So what's your word?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"\"Unknown\". "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The nameless one."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"So you're a senior agent? I thought you were J's subordinate."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"J has been taking care of me since I was little. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"My mother was his mentor. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Also, I'm not a senior agent...yet."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ange studies Light's face and comes to a realization."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You're getting cold feet?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...It would be nice if you didn't put it so bluntly."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You make a much better agent than J. At least that's what I think."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"J simply operates in a different way. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...I'm still too young and inexperienced. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'm not sure if I'm ready to accept this cufflink yet."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Light pinches the cufflink between his fingers and hand it to Ange. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Ange pauses in surprise. Then s